{"id":"618330","name":"红薯梗馅发面饼","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/618330/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"冷冻红薯梗","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜","amount":"少许"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"少许"},{"name":"纯净水(40度左右)","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"红薯梗解冻，挤出多余水分，剁碎，备用。","img":"images/618330/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"蒜剁碎备用。","img":"images/618330/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入盆中，如图所示。","img":"images/618330/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加适量盐、少许五香粉、鸡精和橄榄油调味。","img":"images/618330/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"拌匀即可。","img":"images/618330/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"面粉中加酵母和温水，搅拌成絮状，醒发两倍大，揉成光滑面团。","img":"images/618330/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"搓成长条状，切成大小均匀的剂子。","img":"images/618330/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"擀成圆薄饼。","img":"images/618330/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"包子馅料。","img":"images/618330/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"再擀成薄圆饼。","img":"images/618330/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"平底锅烧热，放入饼胚。","img":"images/618330/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"小火慢烙，烙至两面金黄色即可。","img":"images/618330/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/618330/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"饼薄如纸，如图所示。","img":"images/618330/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"对半切开，方便食用，软而香。","img":"images/618330/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}